-- ============================================================================
-- FC7 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Produced Water Treatment, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE COUPLING AND WHAT A GATE CAN CATCH. Why the next
-- device sees finer water, and why three good devices are not one great one;
-- the two medians and the grid they are measured on; the three ways this module
-- declines to answer, a refusal, a withheld verdict and a warning; the creeping
-- flow band, the full drag balance and a gap that has to be real; what was
-- repaired in this engine, what an independent oracle is and what a green suite
-- means; and where the method stops.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. The order of the stages changes every stage
-- number and not the outlet, because a device removes a fixed fraction of each
-- droplet SIZE and a product does not care about order. And an invariance in a
-- model is a statement about the model: a designer still puts the coarse device
-- first for reasons this module does not carry.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A stage removal is a fact about a device AND a
-- water, so the same device reports very different removals in two positions.
-- The TUNU capstone grades two stage removals, a stage median and the train
-- outlet, on a train whose every cut is computed from its own geometry.
--
-- HELD FOR LITERATURE, and kept out of every graded answer: TUNU has no
-- flotation stage, so the calibration cannot reach it; no dissolved oil floor
-- is given, so no graded concentration is a floored one; no specification is
-- given, so no graded field is a verdict; and the bed is at the reference grain.
-- The one Reynolds number graded is the one the engine reports beside its own
-- Stokes answer at 240 micron, OUTSIDE the band, which is the point of it.
-- ============================================================================

